{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 30, :comments ["<b>יכרו</b> — 'his companions band together against him' (יכרו עליו חברים), from the same root as ויכרה להם, in the sense of a banquet. And the meaning: thieves who joined together." "<b>כנענים</b> — merchants."], :book :job, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 40, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Job -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/eyov/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:05:32.653592216Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}